        "欢迎入住\n希尔伯特无穷旅馆！": "Welcome to\nHilbert's Infinite Hotel!",
        "证明思路：将所有满足f(x)=y\n的数对(x,y)利用\nnatXnat=nat的构造\n编码成单个自然数": "Proof idea: Encode every pair (x,y)\nsatisfying f(x)=y\ninto a single natural number\nusing the construction\nnatXnat=nat",
        "每个nat->nat函数\n由所有编码组成的\n集合唯一确定\n编码的集合显然\n是自然数的子集\n可由nat->Bool描述": "Each function nat->nat\nis uniquely determined\nby the set of all its encodings\nThis set of encodings\nis clearly a subset of nat\nand can be described by nat->Bool",
        "提示：在解锁Even后方\n可解锁Aleph": "Hint: Aleph can be unlocked\nbeyond the place where\nEven is unlocked",
        "拆除门#א_ω": "Remove gate #א_ω",
        "请定义函数Fin:nat->U\n使得Fin(0) === False\nFin(n+1) === Fin(n) + True\n#t:=": "Please define a function Fin:nat->U\nsuch that Fin(0) === False\nand Fin(n+1) === Fin(n) + True\n#t:=",
        "nil表示空列表\ncons x : List a -> List a\n 是个函数，对应向列表追加元素x": "nil represents the empty list\ncons x : List a -> List a\nis a function corresponding to\nadding element x to a list",
        "解锁Option类型": "Unlock the Option type",
        "请定义一个函数fillList :\nPa:U,Px:a,Pn:nat,List a\n它输出n个x组成的列表\n如：fillList Bool 1b 2\n === cons 1b (cons 1b nil)\n#t:=": "Please define a function fillList :\nPa:U,Px:a,Pn:nat,List a\nIt outputs a list consisting of n copies of x\nFor example:\nfillList Bool 1b 2\n === cons 1b (cons 1b nil)\n#t:=",
        "请定义一个函数lastList :\nPa:U,Pl:List a,Option a\n若列表非空则输出\n最后一个放入的值some x\n若列表为nil则输出none\n如 lastList Bool\n(cons 1b (cons 0b nil))\n === some 1b\n#t:=": "Please define a function lastList :\nPa:U,Pl:List a,Option a\nIf the list is non-empty\noutput the last inserted value some x\nIf the list is nil\noutput none\nFor example, lastList Bool\n(cons 1b (cons 0b nil))\n === some 1b\n#t:=",
        "请定义一个函数firstList :\nPa:U,Pl:List a,Option a\n若列表非空则输出\n第一个放入的值some x\n若列表为nil则输出none\n如 firstList Bool\n(cons 1b (cons 0b nil))\n === some 0b\n#t:=": "Please define a function firstList :\nPa:U,Pl:List a,Option a\nIf the list is non-empty\noutput the first inserted value some x\nIf the list is nil\noutput none\nFor example, firstList Bool\n(cons 1b (cons 0b nil))\n === some 0b\n#t:=",
        "请定义一个函数lenList :\nPa:U,Pl:List a,nat\n输出列表中的元素个数\n如lenList False nil === 0\nlenList U (cons nat (cons True nil)) === 2\n#t:=": "Please define a function lenList :\nPa:U,Pl:List a,nat\nOutput the number of elements in the list\nFor example,\nlenList False nil === 0\nlenList U (cons nat (cons True nil)) === 2\n#t:=",
        "请定义一个函数sumList :\n(List nat)->nat\n对列表的所有元素求和\n如sumList (cons 1 (cons 2 (cons 3 nil)))\n === 6\n#t:=": "Please define a function sumList :\n(List nat)->nat\nwhich sums all elements of the list\nFor example,\nsumList (cons 1 (cons 2 (cons 3 nil)))\n === 6\n#t:=",
        "请定义一个函数mapList :\nPa:U,Pb:U,Pf:a->b,List a->List b\n通过函数f把List a中的元素\n一一映射构造List b\n如mapList (List nat) nat sumList\n(cons nil (cons (cons 3 nil) nil))\n === cons 0 (cons 3 nil)\n#t:=": "Please define a function mapList :\nPa:U,Pb:U,Pf:a->b,List a->List b\nwhich maps each element of List a\nthrough function f\nto construct a List b\nFor example,\nmapList (List nat) nat sumList\n(cons nil (cons (cons 3 nil) nil))\n === cons 0 (cons 3 nil)\n#t:=",
        "拆除门#W\n提示：也可以选择不拆除它": "Remove gate #W\nHint: You may also choose\nnot to remove it",
        "请定义一个函数count_0 :\nList nat -> nat\n统计列表中0出现的次数，如\ncount_0 (cons 0 (cons 10 (cons 0 nil)))\n === 2\n#t:=": "Please define a function count_0 :\nList nat -> nat\nwhich counts the number of occurrences of 0\nin the list, for example\ncount_0 (cons 0 (cons 10 (cons 0 nil)))\n === 2\n#t:=",
        "请定义一个函数del_0 :\nList nat -> List nat\n将列表中的所有0删去\n其它元素顺序不变，如\ndel_0 (cons 10 (cons 0 (cons 8 nil)))\n === cons 10 (cons 8 nil)\n#t:=": "Please define a function del_0 :\nList nat -> List nat\nwhich removes all 0s from the list\nwhile preserving the order of other elements\nFor example,\ndel_0 (cons 10 (cons 0 (cons 8 nil)))\n === cons 10 (cons 8 nil)\n#t:=",
